# cluster/.gitignore — keep IO loop data slim
#
# Strategy: ignore large raw MD outputs (GB-scale traj.xyz, intermediate npz,
# SLURM logs) but track the small distilled outputs that go through the
# double-loop with Claude (senior's results, trial outputs).

# SLURM-side raw outputs from cluster jobs
outputs/extracted/
outputs/slab/
outputs/slab_pilot/
outputs/logs/
*.log
*.err

# Intermediate per-system merged npz can be ~100 MB; keep out
results/section0/merged_chain_coords/

# Pilot scratch (anything matching *_pilot/ at any depth)
**/_pilot/
**/pilot_*/
